{"nodes": [{"id": "title", "type": "text", "text": "Module 20 — Threat Prediction with Cyber Threat Intelligence\nCTI role → 4 types → IoC vs IOA → layers → consume → hunt → AI/ML", "x": -1200, "y": -3600, "width": 2400, "height": 70, "color": "5"}, {"id": "b1", "type": "text", "text": "LO01 · CTI ROLE  (pp4-8)\n\nCTI = COLLECTION + ANALYSIS of threat\n+ adversary info for INFORMED\npreparedness/prevention/response\n  grasp WHAT attacker does + HOW TO STOP\n  risk efficiency · persistent-mechanism\n  removal · Identify/Detect/Respond/Recover\n  'indictors' [sic] kept verbatim", "x": -2400, "y": -3420, "width": 600, "height": 700}, {"id": "b2", "type": "text", "text": "LO02 · FOUR TYPES  (pp9-14)\n\nframing says THREE; p14 prints FOURTH\n  STRATEGIC: execs/CISO; posture,\n  financial impact, trends; REPORT form;\n  OSINT/vendors/ISAOs/ISACs\n  TACTICAL: TTPs as forensic reports;\n  campaign/malware/HUMINT; feeds patches\n  OPERATIONAL: specific threats +\n  INTENT/CAPABILITY/OPPORTUNITY; IR +\n  forensics + fraud; often GOV-ONLY\n  TECHNICAL (p14): tools/channels;\n  stealer logs, IOC feeds, CVE; SINGLE-IoC\n  transient scope", "x": -1740, "y": -3420, "width": 600, "height": 700}, {"id": "b3", "type": "text", "text": "LO03 · IoC  (pp15-20)\n\nCLUES/ARTIFACTS/EVIDENCES of intrusion\n  stop REPEATED, UNCHANGED threats;\n  MISS new/modified\n  FORMATS: OpenIOC (printed OpenlOC) ·\n  CybOX · STIX (break-spanning list) ·\n  TAXII models · MAEC container + vocab\n  EXAMPLES (p20 prose): odd outbound,\n  C&C domains, hashes, login oddities,\n  temp-dir MD5 (figure-only item refused)", "x": -1080, "y": -3420, "width": 600, "height": 700}, {"id": "b4", "type": "text", "text": "LO03 · IOA + TABLE  (pp21-24)\n\nIOA = STRATEGIC indicators from INTENT\n+ GOAL + PRE-ATTACK ACTIONS; the 'WHY'\n  visible BEFORE IOCs; NO malware\n  knowledge needed\n  types: EBA, DLLS [sic], code metadata\n  advantages: strategic TTP view;\n  PRE-ENTRY prevention (no malware IN,\n  no tools NEEDED)\n  EXAMPLES: advance persistence [sic],\n  RCE, DNS tunneling, fast-flux,\n  beaconing, honeytoken bursts, C&C\n  heartbeat, exfil, high SMTP\n\nTABLE 20.1\n  reactive/known/post-time/malware vs\n  proactive/situational/real-time/behavior\n  2 cells GARBLED → quoted, unread", "x": -420, "y": -3420, "width": 600, "height": 700, "color": "3"}, {"id": "b5", "type": "text", "text": "LO04 · LAYERS + FEEDS  (pp25-39)\n\nprose FOUR: providers · sources ·\nfeeds · platforms (+ figure-only\nProfessional Services, refused)\n  PROVIDERS: OSS communities OR\n  commercial bodies\n  SOURCES: open/internal/commercial;\n  EMPLOYEES = internal-threat source\n  FEEDS: continuous packaged streams;\n  botnets/C&C/IPs/phishing/mobile\n  FREE + GOV (ENISA, US-CERT/AIS w/\n  quirks) + COMMERCIAL FIVE:\n  RecordedFuture · Broadcom · Team Cymru\n  · Trellix · Anomali (NO prose URLs →\n  omitted; 7 tile-only names excluded)", "x": 240, "y": -3420, "width": 600, "height": 700}, {"id": "b6", "type": "text", "text": "LO04 · PLATFORMS  (pp40-49)\n\nTIP = aggregate/normalize/enrich/\nautomate; processing necessity\n  TC COMPLETE (ratings, votes, FP counts)\n  IBM X-FORCE ('suddenly stop threats')\n  INTELMQ (message-queue CERT tool)\n  USM ANYWHERE (AlienVault Labs stream)\n  + Pulsedive/LookingGlass/iSIGHT/\n  DeepSight/threatnote/AbuseHelper/\n  NetWitness/IntSights/Webroot fragments\n  dashboards pp42-43 = NON-EVIDENCE", "x": 900, "y": -3420, "width": 600, "height": 700}, {"id": "b7", "type": "text", "text": "LO05 · CONSUME + PYRAMID  (pp50-60)\n\nGOALS/NEED/PURPOSE first; proactive\ndefense = ultimate goal\n  evaluate: landscape coverage, DATA AGE\n  CISCO: Firepower + TIDIRECTOR\n  (STIX/TAXII single point)\n  SIEM: local-to-feed scope finding;\n  OSSIM rule list (screenshot refused)\n  MANUAL REVIEW (p58) = obtain + hand-read\n\nPYRAMID OF PAIN (pp59-60)\n  UP = costlier attackers = resilience;\n  TTP-focus wins\n  Trivial HASHES (SHAI/MD5) → Easy IPs\n  (VPN/proxy) → Simple DOMAINS\n  (DDNS + DGAs) → Annoying ARTIFACTS\n  (rejection hurts) → Challenging\n  TOOLS (rebuild research) → Tough!\n  TTPs (counter BEHAVIORS, apex)", "x": -2400, "y": -2620, "width": 620, "height": 700, "color": "4"}, {"id": "b8", "type": "text", "text": "LO06 · HUNT  (pp61-74)\n\nPROACTIVE search for MISSED signs;\nactors dwell MONTHS; non-signature;\nfindings → IR\n  4 STEPS: Hypothesize → Investigate\n  (raw+linked+ML) → UNCOVER patterns\n  (SUCCESS = this) → Enrich analytics\n  BLOCKS: Automation (never restart) ·\n  Enrichment (context) · Visualization\n  (links) · Hunters (curiosity)\n  MATURITY: 0/HMMO empty-OSINT ·\n  1 alert-driven · 2 PROCEDURAL (MOST\n  ORGS) · 3 innovative · 4 leading\n  PRACTICES: environment, visibility,\n  ML speed, UEBA, scans ('out of data'),\n  hunters, dark web, OODA (Detect!)\n  TOOLS: monitoring/SIEM (QRadar×2 [sic])\n  /YARA; Carbon Black, Exabeam, Cynet\n  369+360, Maltego, Log360", "x": -1740, "y": -2620, "width": 620, "height": 700}, {"id": "b9", "type": "text", "text": "LO06b/07 · AI/ML + TOOLS  (pp74-85)\n\nHUNT-AI (p74): 3-item list,\npersistent proactivity\nCTI-AI (p76): auto collect/analyse ·\nML adaptation · SHARING (peers +\n'police enforcement') · skills\n  USES (pp77-78): SUMMARIZE (LLMs) ·\n  IOC extract (social/dark) · TTP extract\n  (long docs) · PREDICT · alerts · LLM\n  EXCHANGE · decisions · real-time\n  ENRICH (p79): context on IPs/domains/\n  hashes; 'ropid7' + dashboard refused\n  PHISHING (p80): known bad domains +\n  accounts; auto/prevent/AI trio\n  SOLUTIONS: Trellix GTI · Watson ·\n  TCPWave · WILDFIRE (tile WILF-IRE,\n  'recieve') · ThreatConnect TIP\n  GUIDELINES (6): proactive · embed ·\n  ALERT QUALITY · provenance · CIA ·\n  bias/diversity", "x": -1080, "y": -2620, "width": 620, "height": 700}, {"id": "pat", "type": "text", "text": "THE MODULE'S FIVE TRAPS\n\n1 · THREE vs FOUR TYPES\n  framing ×2, printed p14 — count the\n  unannounced Technical\n2 · IoC ≠ NEW THREATS\n  repeated/unchanged only; IOAs catch new;\n  pre-entry needs NO malware, NO tools\n3 · PYRAMID DIRECTION\n  UP = resilience; Level 0 = collects\n  NOTHING; most orgs = PROCEDURAL\n4 · ALONE = WEAK\n  TI-alone underperforms; embed it\n5 · PRINTED AS-IS\n  OpenlOC · SHAI · out of data · QRadar×2\n  · Cynet 369 · tremx · ibm-dot ·\n  WILF-IRE · recieve · garbled Table 20.1\n  cells — 'which printed' = exact forms", "x": -420, "y": -2620, "width": 1320, "height": 700, "color": "6"}], "edges": [{"id": "e1", "fromNode": "b1", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "b2", "toSide": "left"}, {"id": "e2", "fromNode": "b2", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "b3", "toSide": "left"}, {"id": "e3", "fromNode": "b3", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "b4", "toSide": "left"}, {"id": "e4", "fromNode": "b4", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "b5", "toSide": "left"}, {"id": "e5", "fromNode": "b5", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "b6", "toSide": "left"}, {"id": "e6", "fromNode": "b6", "fromSide": "bottom", "toNode": "b7", "toSide": "top"}, {"id": "e7", "fromNode": "b7", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "b8", "toSide": "left"}, {"id": "e8", "fromNode": "b8", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "b9", "toSide": "left"}, {"id": "e9", "fromNode": "b9", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "pat", "toSide": "left"}]}